WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.910
We've been talking recently about the improving
numbers when it comes to covid vaccine hesitancy.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:13.139
Some months ago, months ago, at this point,
almost a year back in May, we had somewhere

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:19.700
between two thirds and three quarters of Americans
hesitant about getting a coronavirus vaccine

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.500
when it becomes available.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.500
Vaccines now are available.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.500
We have two vaccines available, a third one
coming soon, maybe a fourth one coming soon.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.660
And the good news is that the vaccine hesitancy
has declined.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:35.020
As far as the covid vaccine is concerned,
it got down to 50 percent, 40 percent.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:41.720
Now, about one third of Americans say they
definitely or probably will not get the covid

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:44.110
vaccine, according to the latest poll.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:49.940
Now, it's good that the hesitancy has declined,
but unfortunately, especially when you're

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:55.550
not going to start vaccinating kids for some
period of time in order to get herd immunity,

00:00:55.550 --> 00:01:00.730
particularly with these more contagious variants,
you need to have close to every adult in the

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:03.540
United States vaccinated to get to herd immunity.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:07.119
So it's still a disaster that one third of
Americans aren't interested.

00:01:07.119 --> 00:01:11.799
But this new poll did something interesting,
which is it actually broke down a variety

00:01:11.799 --> 00:01:16.670
of groups, political groups, racial groups
based on education level.

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:21.670
And we have identified the most anti covid
vaccine groups in the country.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:28.990
And three of these groups are Republicans,
those without a college degree and black Americans.

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:35.720
These are three of the most anti vaccine groups
in the United States for different reasons.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:40.070
Importantly, and members of these different
communities will have different reasons for

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:43.920
telling you why they are skeptical of the
vaccine.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:50.029
Now, the reasons that people tend to cite
as to why they don't plan to get the coronavirus

00:01:50.029 --> 00:01:59.270
vaccine include concerns about side effects,
not trusting the vaccines from a safety standpoint

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:03.109
and not believing that they need the vaccine.

00:02:03.109 --> 00:02:07.759
Not trusting the government is another reason
and not knowing that the vaccine, not believing

00:02:07.759 --> 00:02:10.739
that the vaccine is actually effective.

00:02:10.739 --> 00:02:14.430
So let's look at some of the numbers here.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:21.349
Black Americans are significantly less likely
than white Americans to want the vaccine.

00:02:21.349 --> 00:02:27.379
57 percent of black Americans say they want
the vaccine, compared to 68 percent of white

00:02:27.379 --> 00:02:33.209
Americans, Hispanic Americans, very similar
to white Americans in that in that category.

00:02:33.209 --> 00:02:44.990
Now, this, to some degree is probably related
to historical atrocities that include medical

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:48.620
experimentation with black Americans.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:54.140
And a lot of my black Facebook friends have
been posting a lot about guys.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:03:01.340
While we understand the historical atrocities
related to experimentation, we need this vaccine.

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:03.510
And what we don't want is for our community.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:07.409
This is not not me speaking, but some of my
black friends on Facebook saying we don't

00:03:07.409 --> 00:03:10.300
want our community to end up disproportionately
unvaccinated.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:17.269
That will continue to perpetuate these unequal
outcomes when it comes to vaccination.

00:03:17.269 --> 00:03:22.520
When it comes to education, Americans without
college degrees significantly more likely

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:27.370
than college educated Americans to not want
the vaccine.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:31.640
40 percent of those without college degrees
say no vaccine for me.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:35.940
Only 17 percent of those with college degrees
say no vaccine for me.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.920
So that's not surprising.

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:43.629
Lack of education and lack of just a real
understanding of how the vaccine works, et

00:03:43.629 --> 00:03:49.140
cetera, makes perfect sense that the less
educated you are, the less able to sort of

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.510
parse the scientific data or even know where
to get it.

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.230
That that makes perfect sense, not surprising.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:56.799
And then, of course, Republicans more likely
than Democrats and independents not to want

00:03:56.799 --> 00:03:57.799
the vaccine.

00:03:57.799 --> 00:04:02.620
And that one is pretty obvious when you have
had a party that from day one led by Donald

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:05.180
Trump starting in when when was it right?

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:11.920
January, February played down the risk of
the vaccine of the coronavirus, played up

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:14.200
this idea of it's just the flu played up.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.060
The idea of it's going away soon played up.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.520
The idea of that that's in China.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.730
It's not going to go elsewhere.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.510
And of course, we know that all of those things
were wrong.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:26.380
It makes sense that if you were part of the
political party that that not only spread

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:31.140
those ideas, but actually tried to use them
to justify reelections.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.260
And that failed, at least for Donald Trump.

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.700
It makes sense that you would be.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.220
Less likely to want the vaccine.

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:40.510
Why would you need a vaccine against something
that your party leaders have been telling

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.720
you for a year now is really not that serious
in the end?

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.580
So completely unsurprising as far as that
goes.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:55.860
Now, at some point we have to decide what
are we going to do if a significant portion

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:58.920
of the population never gets vaccinated?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:06.760
I do think that various types of businesses
saying if you want to go to concerts, we organize,

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.390
you'll have to have proof of vaccination.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:10.610
You don't have to get it.

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:11.941
The government's not making you get it.

00:05:11.941 --> 00:05:12.941
We're not making it out.

00:05:12.941 --> 00:05:16.970
We're just saying, if you want to do business
with us, a private business who organizes

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:22.590
concerts or flies people around or whatever,
you will have to choose to go and get the

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:23.590
vaccine.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:28.690
I do think that that will have an impact,
but there are lots of people who just aren't

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:31.370
going to get it unless something significant
changes.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:34.890
I don't know what that's going to be at this
point in time.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.770
And it's something we'll have to continue
talking about.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.580
Let me know if you're surprised by any of
these numbers, any of these groups that are

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.920
the most vaccine hesitant.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:46.370
We'll have more about this on The David Pakman
Show Instagram, which you can find The David

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.370
Pakman Show.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:06:49.530
And while you're there, follow me on Instagram
at David Pakman as well, The David Pakman

00:06:49.530 --> 00:07:01.180
Show at David Pakman Dotcom.

